WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.780
- As we predicted, Rudy
Giuliani is no longer licensed

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.080
to practice in the District of Columbia,

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.260
but don't celebrate
yet because number one,

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:08.940
not only is this
temporary, but number two,

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.660
this is really an administrative thing

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.080
that he had an obligation

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.570
once his law license was
suspended in New York

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.800
to notify the bar of the
District of Columbia,

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.880
which as far as I can tell
are the only two jurisdictions

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.890
where Rudy Giuliani was
licensed to practice law

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:21.850
in the United States.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:23.810
And any bar association upon learning

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:25.520
that you've been suspended
in one jurisdiction

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.180
will also suspend your law
license in that jurisdiction

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:30.530
pending the outcome of that investigation.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.150
And similarly, I would expect
that if the New York courts

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:35.920
permanently revoke Rudy
Giuliani's law license,

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.590
then he would be permanently
revoked in DC as well.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:40.230
So either way, we are
not going to be seeing

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:42.553
Rudy Giuliani in court any time soon.

